{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イルミネーションを見に行ったら、かわいい椅子を発見しました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN7JT6XSDZVXBKWFBAJ45Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちびまる子ちゃんに出てきそうな絵柄の椅子ですよね^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に欲しいくらい気に入りました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN7KSVJETRTC9QMWSS4F5B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n座るところもチェックで可愛かった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツリー🌲"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN7N094230SGP3JJWW2DGQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても綺麗だったなあ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN7P029RV7NJXJ0F7349FV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nここだよー!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYN7PZE33FHNNB0ZPXAWRKF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間があれば、行ってみてね〜\nなーことデートなうで使っておくれƪ(˘⌣˘)ʃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}